ymaster to unlock the Guardians from their prison in hope of freeing the multiverse. Play in normal mode or hard mode for tougher puzzles and quicker mental relfexes.You alone have the will and the abilities to complete this task. You are the Keymaster.", "short_description": "A puzzle adventure that sees you freeing imprisoned guardians in a faraway multiverse. A brainteaser of matching block colours and a test of quick observational skills as you set about your task of being a Keymaster."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://peaznchips.wordpress.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://peaznchips.wordpress.com/", "publisher_name": "Peaznchips Productions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://peaznchips.wordpress.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ARCADE", "EDUCATIONAL", "CASUAL", "PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3104973726409766"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138850_226122381159140_6548247468948062208_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jLlpoklKtkkQ7kNvwEWMMxV&_nc_oc=Adp_2iG_LIxCbWXLGiVTLZwHuIKmHhuow0wVpI4hWdksKGKbvCuCmf239Z8cJpEKmYw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTNEvqN_8Fq0bIMwa40uGGg3Xe8xQvlW9S8sdaMGSE9Rw&oe=6B0B1678"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Keymaster", "platform": "ANDR